cases.shape:
hidden shapes:
- a removed leaf;
- a removed comment with a visible reply three levels down;
- removed > removed > visible;
- an entirely hidden subtree;
- a comment by a blocked account that has visible replies;
- the same account unblocked

the whole flow:
- four accounts, including a second account with the owner's login;
- typed HTML;
- a depth-4 reply chain;
- an anonymous top-level POST and an anonymous reply;
- a cross-report reply;
- checks on / and on both report pages

cases.why:
This is the approved target. It checks:
- the id="comment-<n>" contract;
- the avatar src prefix;
- the 'author' word only on the owner's comments;
- the comment count being absent or exact;
- top-level order;
- that nothing refused is stored.
